WEBVTT

00:04:59.508 --> 00:05:00.706
Now, grief --

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.137
grief is without rules.

00:05:03.332 --> 00:05:05.340
Grief borrows your car without asking,

00:05:05.364 --> 00:05:06.520
wrecks it

00:05:06.544 --> 00:05:08.288
and then doesn't apologize.

00:05:08.312 --> 00:05:09.628
And I was a wreck.

00:05:10.018 --> 00:05:11.168
This was heavy.

00:05:11.192 --> 00:05:12.394
I retreated into myself.

00:05:12.418 --> 00:05:13.674
I was angry.

00:05:13.698 --> 00:05:15.738
I felt betrayed.

00:05:15.762 --> 00:05:17.239
And I guess I should have known

00:05:17.263 --> 00:05:19.646
by the fact that you encouraged
me to be a Mets fan

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.768
that you were preparing me
for life's really big disappointments.

00:05:22.792 --> 00:05:23.842
(Laughter)

00:05:23.866 --> 00:05:25.016
That's true.

00:05:25.678 --> 00:05:27.756
And yet, there were the games of catch,

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.372
and there were the season tickets

00:05:29.396 --> 00:05:31.808
and bacon, egg and cheese
sandwiches every Saturday